7
00:00:25.925 --> 00:00:30.731
Local developer workstations hit two steep walls at the exact same time:

8
00:00:30.731 --> 00:00:36.405
giant coding models normally demand tens of gigabytes of wired memory, and re-running

9
00:00:36.405 --> 00:00:41.678
