10
00:00:42.178 --> 00:00:48.472
Incoming requests first check a zero-multiply Boolean truth-table switch and a tiny constant-size

11
00:00:48.472 --> 00:00:54.505
sequence memory. A calibrated novelty detector wakes four-bit storage-streamed models up to a

12
00:00:54.505 --> 00:01:01.058
hundred twenty billion parameters only on unfamiliar problems, then compiles certified wins downward.

13
00:01:01.558 --> 00:01:07.047
Custom Apple Metal and portable Rust GPU shaders cut unbuffered flash storage reads

14
00:01:07.047 --> 00:01:13.397
twelve point three times at exact token parity, reaching ninety-one point seven percent verified

15
00:01:13.397 --> 00:01:19.349
coding pass and fifty percent on real symbolic math repositories with zero broken commits.

16
00:01:19.849 --> 00:01:26.970
Twenty-seven machine-checked mathematical proofs guarantee lossless target verification on every emitted token and

17
00:01:26.970 --> 00:01:33.779
